            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.2.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 2:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kako mbuboobu mbwaamba Mwami Jehova. Amubone! Ndasitikizya mu-Zioni ibbwe lyakuciswi, lisale, liyandisi, lilisimpikidwe nji, ayooyo uumusyoma takooyoofwambaana kucija. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela njoobika lubeta lube ceelesyo, abululami bube cipimyo. Lino civulamabwe ciyookukula macijilo aazyakubeja, amaanzi ayootonta ciyubilo canu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo cizuminano ncimutangene alufu ciyooloba, akuswiilizyanya kwanu alufu takukooyoojata pe. Mitatula yakukoma yainda buyo, muyoolyataulwa kulinjiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufumbwa ciindi niinda iyoomutola, nkaambo iyooinda cifumo cimwi acimwi, iyooinda isikati amasiku. Nkabela kumvwisya makani kuyooyoosya buyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo bulo bwafwimpa bwakulyolola, acilivumbyo caata cakulivumba. ",
          "type": "text",
