        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo Jehova uyoobuka mbwaakacita kucilundu ca-Perazimu, uyookalala mbwaakakalala mukuti lya-Gibeoni, kuti abeleke milimo yakwe, milimo iiyoosya, akumanisya incito zyakwe, incito iigambya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mutasampauli pe, cita zyaanzyo zyanu zijatisye, nkaambo ku-Mwami Jehova wamakamu ndimvwide impuo yamamanino aakosokede aati sike kunyika yoonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
